//  cap, so NO hipFuncSetAttribute opt-in (unlike the MHC 256 KB bug).
//
//  This is the simple, correct baseline (one lane per key, sequential
//  H-sum); a tiled-key / MFMA-fp8 prefetch is a follow-on optimisation.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
